          </summary>
          <p class="px-6 pb-5 text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you need to change an invoice, you should generally cancel or void the original invoice and issue a new one with a new invoice number to keep your accounting records clean and prevent confusion.</p>
        </details>

